  "description": "Zensurf's hardened, high-performance SQLite ADO.NET provider for .NET 10. A fully custom, drop-in style replacement for Microsoft.Data.Sqlite with direct source-generated P/Invoke interop, per-connection prepared-statement caching, connection pooling, DbBatch support, and secure-by-default SQLite runtime hardening (defensive mode, untrusted schema, double-quoted string literals disabled).",
